{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20839","headline":"绿章封事 · 李贺","name":"绿章封事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青霓扣额呼宫神，鸿龙玉狗开天门。\n石榴花发满溪津，溪女洗花染白云。\n绿章封事谘元父，六街马蹄浩无主。\n虚空风气不清泠，短衣小冠作尘土。\n金家香衖千轮鸣，杨雄秋室无俗声。\n愿携汉戟招书鬼，休令恨骨填蒿里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}